  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Consider the relations <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> defined as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>b</mi><mo>⇔</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> for all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇔</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math> for all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>∈</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></math>. Then</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
